DEBUG:docling.backend.md_backend:Some other element: <Paragraph children=[<RawText children='Reproduction is the cornerstone of life, occurring through '>,
 <StrongEmphasis children=[<RawText children='asexual'>]>,
 <RawText children=' (cloning) or '>,
 <StrongEmphasis children=[<RawText children='sexual'>]>,
 <RawText children=(' (gamete fusion) mechanisms. Asexual reproduction offers speed but little '
 'genetic diversity, while sexual reproduction—found in most plants and '
 'animals—generates variation essential for evolution. In plants, pollination, '
 'fertilization, and seed formation link the male and female structures of '
 'flowers. Animals display a wide range of reproductive strategies, from '
 'external fertilization in fish to internal gestation in mammals. Human '
 'reproduction follows a well‑coordinated hormonal cycle, culminating in '
 'fertilization, implantation, and development. Understanding the sources of '
 'genetic variation (crossing‑over, independent assortment, random '
 'fertilization, mutations) explains how species adapt and evolve.')>]>
DEBUG:docling.backend.md_backend: - RawText/Literal: Reproduction is the cornerstone of life, occurring through 
